OL,3,GNEWSA'Rising costs' mean music festival
OL,4,Awill not return
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Wildlife Park has announced
OL,7,Fits annual two-day music festival, Wild
OL,8,FLive, will not be returning next year
OL,9,Fbecause it can no longer justify the
OL,10,Fcost of running it.
OL,12,FWild Live at the Doncaster attraction
OL,13,Fwill take place for the final time on
OL,14,F29 and 30 August.
OL,16,FThe park has blamed rising operational
OL,17,Fcosts and the cost of living crisis as
OL,18,Freasons for its cancellation.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
