OL,3,GNEWSA'Rising costs' mean music festival
OL,4,Awill not return
OL,5,
OL,6,FPark director Cheryl Williams said: "In
OL,7,Fprevious years, we've seen a good
OL,8,Fprofit margin, but latterly, the costs
OL,9,Fhave gone up exponentially."
